{"parse": {"title": "TSW-08", "pageid": 100962, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-07\" title=\"TSW-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TSW-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TSW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.96.B0.E7.9A.84.E5.AE.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"新的家\">新的家</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 新的家</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A New Home</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>风<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>向<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192308</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>塞洛尼，那本书你看完了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>我看完了，可是我没有看懂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>上面说，面对不一样的人，称呼是不一样的，笑容也要不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>称呼不一样我能理解，但是……笑容怎么不一样呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>书上是这么写的：要先提起眉毛，再翘起嘴唇，像这样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海岛的女孩用手指提起自己的嘴角，展示出一个不甚熟练的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她随即松开手，真正地笑了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我知道了！哥哥捕鱼的时候会笑得很痛快，爬上树去摘果子，一不小心滑下来的时候，会笑得很滑稽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>我们要学会滑稽的笑吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我觉得我们只要学会痛快的笑就好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>就像这样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她发出一阵爽朗的笑声，如此熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-504720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅰ：</div><div>那不是和以前一样嘛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-518620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-518620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-518620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅱ：</div><div>痛快的笑，我们用不着学习！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>是的，努库泰澳人一向知道该怎么做~</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>平静的湖面留下欢声笑语。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_gouhuo\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_gouhuo\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_gouhuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当第一条告诫在贝壳上显现的时候，我们抵达了别处、岛和永恒的土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小船儿哟，停泊在沙儿上</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当第二条告诫在贝壳上显现的时候，我们生起熊熊篝火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>欢乐的人们哟，日日年年</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当第三条告诫在贝壳上显现的时候，我们习得海的慷慨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纯洁的海风哟，映照我身</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>好啦，图图石子，我要去图书馆了～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>我要去看一本新的书……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>下次再讲给你听！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅰ：</div><div>我们要去学那个钟表维修……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-625320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅱ：</div><div>花了一天，那本书我们也只看完了一页！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-519620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">努库泰澳人Ⅰ：</div><div>真是个大工程……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>努库泰澳的伙伴离开了，继续为自己的生活忙碌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子静静地站在湖边，凝望着湖面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的胸前，除了原先拥有的贝壳项链，又有了崭新的变化。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_ys_tutushizi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_ys_tutushizi\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_ys_tutushizi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-2_7_at_ys_tutushizi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_ys_tutushizi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-2_7_at_ys_tutushizi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_ys_tutushizi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-2_7_at_ys_tutushizi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_ys_tutushizi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚在海浪间跳动的音符勋章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张闪闪发光的复古迷你唱片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张描绘四季景色的拼贴邮票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚崭新轻巧的单链银质怀表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>串起一条新的项链。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>湖面掠来风，海岛的女孩闭上眼睛，想象着这风将吹向何时何地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轻轻哼唱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>吞没在浪潮之中，吹散在海风之中，消弭在迷雾之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海妖之歌，勿使我迷失航向；梦魇之声，勿使我忘却归路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝壳的告诫警醒我，贝壳的纹路指引我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我将归来，我已归来。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TSW-08"}}